{
  "project": {
    "name": "Landing Skid",
    "slug": "landing-skid",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Printable landing gear for FPV & RC multirotors. A splayed leg drops from the frame to a skid foot, protecting the belly, camera and gimbal on landing. It attaches by clamping around a round arm/boom, or by bolting to a frame plate using the standard square motor bolt pattern. Choose a boom-clamp skid, a bolt-on skid, or a tall gear for camera / cargo clearance.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Tren de aterrizaje imprimible para multirotores FPV y RC. Una pata abierta baja del cuadro a un patin, protegiendo el vientre, la camara y el gimbal al aterrizar. Se fija sujetando un brazo redondo, o atornillando a una placa del cuadro con el patron cuadrado estandar del motor. Elige un patin de abrazadera, un patin atornillado o un tren alto para camara / carga.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/landing-skid.webp",
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
